{"sourceUrl":"https://www.sei.ynu.edu.cn/info/1057/2652.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:52.874830+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.sei.ynu.edu.cn/info/1057/2652.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>     为持续提升我院研究生优质生源储备，精准发掘、吸纳全国优秀大学生到我院交流，我院将于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>23</span><span>日至</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日举办全国优秀大学生线上夏令营活动</span><span>,</span><span>特制定本次夏令营活动方案。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>     本届夏令营活动拟招收营员</span>60<span>人，涉及专业包括：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>      </span>学硕：软件工程（</span>0835<span>）、网络空间安全（</span><span>0839</span><span>）、智能科学与技术（</span><span>1405</span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>      </span>专硕：软件工程（</span>085405<span>）、网络与信息安全（</span><span>085412</span><span>）、人工智能（</span><span>085410</span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>      </span>软件学院（人工智能学院）研究生培养办公室负责对本次夏令营参营学生进行资格审查，具体条件包括：</span></p>\n<p><span>（一）具有坚定的社会主义理想信念，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好，诚实守信，学风端正，身心健康，申请者原则上须为具备推免资格高校（附件</span><span>3</span><span>）</span><span>2027</span><span>届全日制本科应届毕业生。</span></p>\n<p><span>（二）学习成绩优异，对本领域的科学研究有着浓厚兴趣，具有较强的科研创新能力。原则上本科前三年总评成绩排名应在所学专业前</span><span>30%</span><span>。成绩未达到所学专业前</span><span>30%</span><span>，但在其他方面有优异表现者（科研成果突出，在有影响力的刊物公开发表论文，在相关学科表现优异获得国家级奖项等）亦可申请。</span></p>\n<p><span>（三）英语四级成绩原则上应达到</span><span>450 </span><span>分以上，</span><span>TOEFL </span><span><span>成绩</span>≥</span><span>60 </span><span>分，雅思</span><span> (A </span><span>类学术类</span><span>) </span><span>≥</span><span>5 </span><span>分，</span><span>GRE</span><span>≥</span><span>260 </span><span>分。</span></p>\n<p><span>（四）须具有一定的学科背景，有志于从事计算机科学与技术、软件工程、网络空间安全、人工智能等学科学术研究工作，具有一定的或潜在的科研能力。</span></p>\n<p><span>（五）身心健康、学风端正、品德良好，无任何学术不端行为及违法违纪等受处分记录。</span></p>\n<p><span>（六）需持至少</span><span>2</span><span>位拥有副教授以上职称专家的推荐信。</span></p>\n<p><span>二、</span><strong><span>参营报名与资格审查安排</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>     为保障夏令营组织工作有序开展，本次夏令营报按照以下时间节点组织实施。</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>一）</span><span>报名与材料提交。申请人须于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>4</span><span>日至</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日上午11点期间报名并提交报名材料，逾期原则上不再受理。申请人一般应提交以下电子版材料：</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>《云南大学全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（附件</span><span>4</span><span><span>）</span>;</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>本人有效身份证件及学生证扫描件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>本科前三年完整成绩单（须加盖所在本科院校教务部门公章）</span>;</span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span>本科阶段专业排名证明或综合测评排名证明，须加盖所在院系或教务部门公章；</span></p>\n<p><span>5.</span><span>英语水平证明材料，包括大学英语四、六级成绩单，或</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>IELTS</span><span>、</span><span>GRE</span><span>等成绩证明材料；</span></p>\n<p><span>6.</span><span>至少</span><span>2</span><span>位拥有副教授以上职称专家的推荐信；</span></p>\n<p><span>7.</span><span>其他材料（学术论文、专利证书、各级各类获奖证书或资格证书证明材料等）。</span></p>\n<p><span>以上资格审查所需材料，请申请人按材料顺序扫描制作成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，不同材料之间插入一页空白页面只写</span><span>1</span><span>、</span><span>2</span><span>、</span><span>...</span><span>7</span><span>分割上述项目。</span><strong><span><span>文件以</span>“申请专业名称（专业代码</span></strong><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span>专业名）</span></strong><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span>姓名</span></strong><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span>联系电话</span></strong><strong><span>_</span></strong><strong><span><span>报名材料</span>”命名。以上材料按学位类型在</span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong><strong><span>月</span><span><span>22</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日（星期三）上午11</span></span></strong><strong><span>:00</span></strong><strong><span><span>前</span></span></strong><strong><span>同时</span></strong><strong><span><span>提交到以下对应邮箱</span></span></strong><strong><span>及在线连接（邮箱提交一次，在线链接提交一次）：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学术型硕士发邮件至</span></span><a href=\"mailto:zajhsc@126.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>zajhsc@126.com</span></a><span>，</span><span><span>并同时提交至【腾讯文档】软件学院（人工智能学院）</span>2026<span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请材料（学硕）</span><span>https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DUXhicmZCWUdMa2RB </span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>专业型硕士发邮件至</span>zs_rjxy_ynu@163.com</span><span>，</span><span>并同时提交至</span><span><span>【腾讯文档】软件学院（人工智能学院）</span>2026<span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请材料（专硕）</span><span>https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DUURNdVRMU0VRcHR1</span></span><span> <span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.sei.ynu.edu.cn/__local/F/2D/48/15F8297F91A3EA06E72B6AC25D4_738DCB82_8E19.png\"/></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><br/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.sei.ynu.edu.cn/__local/B/C7/ED/EB1C8D81DBF411EAE2D9DA80F9B_48ED4B0B_8C5C.png\"/></p></td>\n<td><br/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><br/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><br/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span>（</span><span>二）</span><span>资格审查。</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日至</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日，学院研究生培养办公室会同相关学科方向和科研创新团队，对申请人提交材料进行资格审查。审查内容主要包括思想政治表现、学业成绩、专业背景、外语水平、科研创新能力、竞赛获奖情况等。入选学生须在规定时间内确认是否参营，未按时确认者视为自动放弃参营资格。</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>三）</span><span>参营确认与材料汇总。</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日，学院完成营员信息确认、线上报到准备、分组安排及相关材料汇总工作</span><span>，</span><strong><span><span>请提交了申请材料的学生务必在</span>7<span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日上午</span><span>11</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>前加入</span><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span></span></strong><strong><span>745356503</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、时间安排</span></strong><strong><span>和组织形式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>本次夏令营时间安排为</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>23</span><span>日至</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日（线上进行），时间安排如下：</span></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span>日期</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>时间</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>主题</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>具体内容</span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"6\"><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>23</span><span>日（周四）</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>8:30-9:00</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>营员报到</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>线上报到</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>播放宣传视频</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>9:00-11:45</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>学院总体介绍、创新团队介绍与科研情况</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）介绍学院总体情况（</span><span>9:00-9:30</span><span>）</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）分布式与网络空间安全创新团队代表介绍团队具体情况与进展（</span><span>9:30-10:15</span><span>）</span><span><br/></span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）智慧医养创新团队代表介绍团队具体情况与进展（</span><span>10:15-11:00</span><span>）</span><span><br/></span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）智能软件创新团队代表介绍团队具体情况与进展（</span><span>11:00-11:45</span><span>）</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>14:00-16:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>名师专题讲座</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>名师分享学术人生与智慧，让学生体悟学术精神，树立学术理想</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>1</span><span>6:00-17:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>研究生会代表学习经验分享交流</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>在读优秀研究生分享学习经验</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>7</span><span>月<span>2</span></span><span>4</span><span>日（周</span><span>五</span><span>）</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>9:00-16:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>专业交流</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>具体安排以学院通知为准</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>16:00-17:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>结营典礼</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>对夏令营活动进行总结</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span></span><br/></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、特别说明</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>（一）本次夏令营旨在促进学术交流与宣传，所有参与同学均不涉及推免资格排序考核或预录取承诺。</span></p>\n<p><span>（二）本次夏令营不收取报名费、参营费等任何费用。</span></p>\n<p><span>（三）入选营员须严格遵守云南大学及学院相关规章制度，按照学院统一安排全程参加夏令营活动，无特殊情况不得缺席或擅自退出。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>软件学院（人工智能学院）研究生培养办公室：</span><span>0871-65933527</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>软件学院（人工智能学院）</span></p>\n<p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7月13日</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"210895a8ae3f261a059739230679cb467a4ea21119176b3f50f6c9cde4c3b659","textLength":2250,"sourceSha256":"1586df596615bf736fead0853f2ff0d1499e2143e87199e81e28d4e9e50499a4","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件3.全国具有推免资格高校名单2026（更新）.xlsx","url":"https://www.sei.ynu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1418611494&wbfileid=17948341"},{"name":"附件4.云南大学全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表.doc","url":"https://www.sei.ynu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1418611494&wbfileid=17948342"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-dd45be825f15298745bc","title":"2026年云南大学软件学院（人工智能学院）2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:52.874830+00:00"}
